    "rating": 4.9,
    "reference": "ChIJKVWK8hw2V0AR6QBL7qRn40k",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "GAIL LAFF",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104261622319975044468/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFTNIzt22TdWsEQL5lV-jgmwSXp3n1Xlr_AyATAFQpxDYVPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "This is a very exceptional Boutique.  I am so impressed with their passion, service and attention to customer service.  Their response to their chat line, voicemail or email is almost immediate.  Not a week later!  Lisa and her staff made me feel so special.  I not only left looking great, but my spirits were lifted as well!  These are very genuine good women who offer old school service.  The variety of garments can be complimented with their selection of jewelry, purses, shoes, masks;  one stop shop!\nDuring these difficult times Lisa made my first visit; my best day in a very long time.  Please know that your attention to detail is appreciated!",
        "time": 1613256935,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michelle Menard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105770306347157179816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrP3fqIrpMijBZMg6vlph0iQPfjffE8sI3_8J8sNV_fzQCXQsQKA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I can see why they have excellent reviews. I received kind, attentive, friendly service to help me find a beautiful pair of jeans that I love. It was a fun experience and I will definitely be back. They care about their customers and it makes a difference. My toddler loved it, and even my husband said it was a nice outing.",
        "time": 1671320880,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tina Dolce",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111119672661128450616/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVD1hVAd7LwBA82luep7Wp7dzWnF8COIHbhL-oMlQ0Z3sAS0p4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "So impressed with this boutique Fashionwear . I been buying since the owner Lisa was selling out of her home and Ruby Foos more then 25 years ago . Now , 2 boutiques and lots of online service . However , still remains very personalized and high fashion . I love how the owner takes super care of her clients . Not to mention the shopping dollars and the beautiful shopping bags 🛍️. I wish you continued success always Lisa and the full staff . I give this Fashionwear boutique A+++ grazie Bella ❤️",
        "time": 1682955162,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A.J. Hurst",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112447494519393030696/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJ44lusud8AyhrDJz_LY8vzpyN83WInp17GqZ4HRvzOxxS2HcF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "How can I say thank you enough?  The clothes fit as described and they're gorgeous.  I'm very excited to have Canadian made fashion to enjoy.  I loved the packaging and the sparkles on the address and the wrapping and little gift inside.  It made it a very special experience.  I turned my back on fast fashion and this was my first experience with an online Canadian company.  I'll never go back.\nMany thanks!",
        "time": 1575254605,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Wendy MacDonald",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101077471624331947546/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTf3zfF2VLDyjEV15XInDMDMCa1MzMA4vAiXI4jxXhGNO79w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I have been shopping here for years. The  service and excellent wardrobe advice are consistent. Best part is they remember what I buy and can help me add to an existing outfit for an event with something already purchased. Staff is always friendly and courteous! I love that the clothes are unique and good quality.",
        "time": 1611184538,
        "translated": false
      }
